{"page":269,"width":1679,"height":2338,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"8.5 반복적 순회","words":[{"text":"8.5","x":161,"y":189,"width":55,"height":46},{"text":"반복적","x":232,"y":185,"width":124,"height":50},{"text":"순회","x":371,"y":185,"width":84,"height":49}]},{"text":"앞에서는 순회를 순환 호출을 이용하여 구현하있다. 물론 이것이 표준적인 방법이고 쉽게 이해","words":[{"text":"앞에서는","x":161,"y":323,"width":108,"height":30},{"text":"순회를","x":281,"y":321,"width":82,"height":31},{"text":"순환","x":374,"y":321,"width":55,"height":30},{"text":"호출을","x":440,"y":321,"width":81,"height":31},{"text":"이용하여","x":533,"y":321,"width":103,"height":32},{"text":"구현하있다.","x":650,"y":321,"width":139,"height":31},{"text":"물론","x":804,"y":322,"width":52,"height":30},{"text":"이것이","x":868,"y":320,"width":75,"height":32},{"text":"표준적인","x":957,"y":319,"width":105,"height":32},{"text":"방법이고","x":1075,"y":319,"width":107,"height":32},{"text":"쉽게","x":1195,"y":317,"width":51,"height":31},{"text":"이해","x":1261,"y":317,"width":51,"height":31}]},{"text":"될 수 있는 방법이지만 우리는 반혁-을 이용해서도 트리 순회를 할 수 있다. 물론. 이 경우에는 스","words":[{"text":"될","x":160,"y":375,"width":23,"height":30},{"text":"수","x":195,"y":375,"width":28,"height":29},{"text":"있는","x":235,"y":374,"width":53,"height":30},{"text":"방법이지만","x":299,"y":373,"width":135,"height":31},{"text":"우리는","x":443,"y":373,"width":82,"height":31},{"text":"반혁-을","x":535,"y":374,"width":80,"height":30},{"text":"이용해서도","x":626,"y":373,"width":131,"height":32},{"text":"트리","x":767,"y":373,"width":49,"height":31},{"text":"순회를","x":828,"y":374,"width":79,"height":30},{"text":"할","x":916,"y":373,"width":27,"height":31},{"text":"수","x":952,"y":374,"width":26,"height":30},{"text":"있다.","x":989,"y":373,"width":58,"height":31},{"text":"물론.","x":1059,"y":373,"width":61,"height":30},{"text":"이","x":1134,"y":371,"width":23,"height":31},{"text":"경우에는","x":1171,"y":369,"width":108,"height":33},{"text":"스","x":1288,"y":372,"width":26,"height":23}]},{"text":"대이 필요하다. 스택에 자식 노드들을 저장하고 꺼내면서 순회를 할 수 있는 것이다. 순환 호출","words":[